name: ['Aerial Extortionist', 'Aether Snap', "Agent's Toolkit", 'Agitator Ant', 'Ajani Unyielding', 'Alela, Artful Provocateur', 'Angelic Sleuth', 'Anhelo, the Painter', 'Arasta of the Endless Web', 'Arcane Sanctum', 'Arcane Signet', 'Archon of Coronation', 'Army of the Damned', 'Artifact Mutation', 'Artisan of Kozilek', 'Ash Barrens', 'Assemble the Legion', 'Audacious Swap', 'Aura Mutation', 'Austere Command', 'Aven Courier', 'Aven Mimeomancer', 'Avenger of Zendikar', 'Avenging Huntbonder', 'Awakening Zone', 'Azorius Signet', 'Bant Charm', 'Bant Panorama', 'Beast Within', 'Beastmaster Ascension', 'Bedevil', 'Bellowing Mauler', 'Bennie Bracks, Zoologist', 'Bess, Soul Nourisher', 'Blasphemous Act', 'Blighted Woodland', 'Bloodsoaked Champion', 'Bloodthirsty Blade', 'Body Count', 'Boros Charm', "Boss's Chauffeur", 'Boxing Ring', 'Bribe Taker', 'Brokers Confluence', 'Cabaretti Confluence', 'Caldaia Guardian', 'Call the Coppercoats', 'Call the Skybreaker', 'Camaraderie', 'Canopy Vista', 'Cascade Bluffs', 'Castle Ardenvale', 'Castle Embereth', 'Cephalid Facetaker', 'Chain Reaction', 'Champion of Lambholt', 'Champion of Wits', 'Change of Plans', 'Chaos Warp', 'Chasm Skulker', 'Choked Estuary', 'Cinder Glade', 'Clone Legion', 'Command Tower', "Commander's Sphere", 'Commit // Memory', 'Contractual Safeguard', 'Crash the Party', 'Creeping Tar Pit', 'Crumbling Necropolis', 'Cryptic Pursuit', 'Crystalline Giant', 'Cultivate', 'Currency Converter', 'Custodi Lich', 'Damnable Pact', 'Damning Verdict', 'Daring Saboteur', 'Darkwater Catacombs', 'Daxos of Meletis', 'Deathbringer Regent', 'Deathreap Ritual', 'Declaration in Stone', 'Deep Analysis', 'Denry Klin, Editor in Chief', 'Determined Iteration', 'Devoted Druid', 'Dig Through Time', 'Dimir Signet', 'Disciple of Bolas', 'Dodgy Jalopy', 'Dogged Detective', 'Double Vision', 'Dragonlord Ojutai', 'Drana, Liberator of Malakir', 'Drawn from Dreams', 'Dread Summons', "Duelist's Heritage", 'Dusk // Dawn', 'Esper Panorama', 'Etali, Primal