atures with power 3 or greater.', "Destroy all creatures with power greater than target creature's power.", "Destroy all nonland creatures.\nAwaken 4—{5}{W}{W}{W} (If you cast this spell for {5}{W}{W}{W}, also put four +1/+1 counters on target land you control and it becomes a 0/0 Elemental creature with haste. It's still a land.)", 'Destroy six target creatures.', 'Destroy target artifact, creature, or planeswalker.', "Destroy target artifact. It can't be regenerated. Create X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens, where X is that artifact's mana value.", "Destroy target creature or enchantment an opponent controls. You lose life equal to that permanent's mana value.", "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", "Destroy target enchantment. Create X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens, where X is that enchantment's mana value.", 'Destroy target permanent. Its controller creates a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'Destroy target permanent. Its controller creates a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', "Dethrone (Whenever this creature attacks the player with the most life or tied for the most life, put a +1/+1 counter on it.)\nPark Heights Maverick can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.\nWhenever Park Heights Maverick deals combat damage to a player or dies, proliferate.", 'Double strike\nWhenever Avenging Huntbonder attacks, put a double strike counter on another target attacking creature.', 'Draw a card for each creature you control.\nFerocious — You gain 4 life for each creature you control with power 4 or greater.', 'Draw cards equal to the greatest power among creatures you control.\nYou may cast a spell with mana value 5 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Draw three cards. You may play an additional land this turn.', 'Draw two cards, then discard two cards. Untap up to three lands.', 'Each creature spell you cast with mana value 4 or greater has blitz. The blitz cost is equal to its mana cost. (You 